<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Even when faith is small,</l><l>When there’s no hope at all,</l><l>I hear Him say to me,</l><l>Trust in Me and you’ll see,</l><l>That I’ll supply all your needs,</l><l>If only you will believe.</l><l>All anxious doubts will cease,</l><l>While trusting in Me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
